<title>RUSSIA: Russian Jan pulp output falls to 101,00 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Russian Jan pulp output falls to 101,00 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's pulp production in January was 101,000 tonnes, or 16 percent less than a year earlier, the State Statistics Committee said on Monday.</p>
<p>Cardboard output was 73,000 tonnes, or 16 percent more than in January 1996, it said.</p>
<p>    (pct change)	     Jan 97	  Dec 96	 Jan 96</p>
